{"suttaId":"tha-ap320","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9359,9383],"vripara":"39"},"segments":{"tha-ap320:0.3":"Tiraṃsiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap320:1.1":"“Kesariṃ abhijātaṃva, aggikkhandhaṃva pabbate;","tha-ap320:1.3":"Obhāsentaṃ disā sabbā [nivāsentaṃ (ka.), disāsinnaṃ (syā.)], siddhatthaṃ pabbatantare.","tha-ap320:2.1":"“Sūriyassa ca ālokaṃ, candālokaṃ tatheva ca;","tha-ap320:2.3":"Buddhālokañca disvāna, vitti me udapajjatha.","tha-ap320:3.1":"“Tayo āloke disvāna, sambuddhaṃ [buddhañca (sī.)] sāvakuttamaṃ;","tha-ap320:3.3":"Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap320:4.1":"“Tayo hi ālokakarā, loke lokatamonudā;","tha-ap320:4.3":"Cando ca sūriyo cāpi, buddho ca lokanāyako.","tha-ap320:5.1":"“Opammaṃ upadassetvā, kittito me mahāmuni;","tha-ap320:5.3":"Buddhassa vaṇṇaṃ kittetvā, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ.","tha-ap320:6.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ buddhamabhikittayiṃ;","tha-ap320:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kittanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap320:7.1":"“Ekasaṭṭhimhito kappe, eko ñāṇadharo ahu;","tha-ap320:7.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap320:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap320:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tiraṃsiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap320:10.1":"Tiraṃsiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
